    ; element, while `x["00"]`, `x[-1]`, `x["1.0"]` and `x[true]` are properties
    ; that do not move `length`. Only ToString(ToUint32(k)) === k qualifies, and
    ; 2^32-1 is deliberately excluded -- it is the one uint32 that is not an index.
